{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは、渡辺です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/31/6092555/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと数時間で2016年が終わろうとしてますね...\n明日にはもう2017年なのか〜って\n考えるとすごくあっという間な\n気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この1年でアンダーの\n1列目、2列目、3列目をすべて\n経験しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中やNOGIBINGO!7、\nじょしらく2舞台、\nアンダーライブ地方に武道館、\nグラビア雑誌の撮影、\n今までにした事のない経験も\nたくさんさせて頂きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのユニット曲にも参加させて頂きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回撮影後は自分の反省を\n日記に書くようにしていて\n改めて読み返すと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分を上手くさらけ出せてなくて\n来年にむけての大きな課題です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様へ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな頼り無い私ですが、\nイベントある事に応援に駆けつけて頂き\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が笑顔でいられるのは\n本当に皆様のおかげです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかトンネルを出た時、\n隣で笑顔でいてくれたら嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年度も宜しくお願い致します"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/31/6092555/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月誕生日の方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/31/6092555/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます〜(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃん、生駒さん、伊藤衆人監督\nお誕生日おめでとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/12/31/6092555/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も紅白2年連続で出させていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出れる事を有り難く思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、行ってきます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良いお年を。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}